    multiplier that controls the interpolated blend between the projected planes.
    Higher values means harder blends while lower means softer;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.StickyNoteNode,
    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;114;-208,-2480;Inherit;False;329;117;;;0,0,0,1;It
    projects 1 texture from all 3 planes in both positive and negative axis, effectively
    wrapping the object with 1 texture;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.StickyNoteNode,
